---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/Navbar.astro";
import "../../styles/global.css";
---

<MainLayout title="Yoyo | LSTM航空发动机RUL预测">

<Navbar />

<section class="project-page">

<a class="back-link" href="/resume">← 返回简历 <span class="en">← Back to Resume</span></a>

<div class="hero">
<div class="hero-icon">✈️</div>
<h1>
基于 LSTM 的航空发动机剩余寿命预测研究
<span class="en">LSTM-based Aero-engine Remaining Useful Life Prediction</span>
</h1>
<p>
第一主持人 · 国豪论坛学术汇报
<span class="en">Lead Researcher · Guohao Forum Academic Presentation</span>
</p>
</div>

<section class="card">
<h2>
项目概述
<span class="en">Project Overview</span>
</h2>
<p>
本项目针对航空发动机关键部件的剩余寿命（RUL）预测问题，基于LSTM深度学习模型构建预测系统。航空发动机作为飞机的"心脏"，其剩余寿命预测对飞行安全与维护成本控制至关重要。
<span class="en">This project addresses the Remaining Useful Life (RUL) prediction of key aero-engine components using LSTM deep learning. Accurate RUL prediction is critical for flight safety and maintenance cost control.</span>
</p>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>
我的角色
<span class="en">My Role</span>
</h2>
<p class="role-intro">
第一主持人，独立承担：
<span class="en">Lead Researcher, independently responsible for:</span>
</p>
<ul>
<li>
数据预处理（时间序列清洗、归一化、滑窗切片）
<span class="en">Data preprocessing (time series cleaning, normalization, sliding window slicing)</span>
</li>
<li>
LSTM 模型架构设计与调参
<span class="en">LSTM architecture design and hyperparameter tuning</span>
</li>
<li>
训练策略优化（学习率调度、梯度裁剪、早停机制）
<span class="en">Training strategy optimization (LR scheduling, gradient clipping, early stopping)</span>
</li>
<li>
实验验证与对比分析
<span class="en">Experimental validation and comparative analysis</span>
</li>
<li>
论文撰写与学术汇报
<span class="en">Paper writing and academic presentation</span>
</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>
技术路线
<span class="en">Technical Approach</span>
</h2>
<div class="pipeline">
<div>数据采集</div>
<span>→</span>
<div>预处理</div>
<span>→</span>
<div>LSTM建模</div>
<span>→</span>
<div>训练优化</div>
<span>→</span>
<div>预测验证</div>
</div>
<div class="tags">
<span>LSTM</span>
<span>Time Series</span>
<span>RUL Prediction</span>
<span>Deep Learning</span>
<span>Aerospace</span>
</div>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>
核心成果
<span class="en">Key Results</span>
</h2>
<ul>
<li>
优化模型结构与调参策略，显著提升预测精度
<span class="en">Optimized model structure and tuning strategies, significantly improved prediction accuracy</span>
</li>
<li>
在同济大学"国豪论坛"进行学术汇报
<span class="en">Academic presentation at Tongji University "Guohao Forum"</span>
</li>
<li>
科研墙报获得多位老师与同学好评
<span class="en">Research poster received positive feedback from multiple faculty and students</span>
</li>
</ul>
</section>

